<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Nishat Mills omits dividend.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Nishat Mills omits dividend.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales			   6,748 vs 6,157</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	     145 vs     4</p>
<p>    Profit after tax		135 vs    29</p>
<p>    Dividend			  Nil vs   Nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Nishat Mills Limited. The company has not announced any dividend, bonus stocks or rights issues. AGM on March 31 at Faisalabad. Book closure March 31 to April 6.</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees)  -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
